### =========================================================================
### TEST SINCRONIZARE SI STERGERE CASCADATA (ASSIGNMENT 1)
### =========================================================================

@userApi = http://localhost/user-service
@deviceApi = http://localhost/device-service

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### PASUL 1: Inserare Utilizator Nou in user-service
### user-service genereaza UUID-ul, apeleaza intern device-service (tabela user_account)
### si abia apoi salveaza in user_db (tabela person).
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{userApi}}/person
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ionescu Radu - Test Sync",
  "address": "Strada Baritiu 26, Cluj-Napoca",
  "age": 30
}

> {%
    client.test("Status este 200 sau 201", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200 || response.status === 201, "Status gresit la creare user");
    });
    // Salveaza automat UUID-ul utilizatorului creat
    client.global.set("syncUserId", response.body);
    client.log("User creat cu ID: " + response.body);
%}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### PASUL 2: Inserare Dispozitiv alocat utilizatorului proaspat creat
### Trimitem 'userId' setat cu variabila {{syncUserId}} obtinuta la Pasul 1.
### Foreign Key-ul din device_db valideaza existenta in user_account fara GET extern!
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{deviceApi}}/device
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Smart Meter - Test Cascada",
  "address": "Strada Baritiu 26, Apartament 4",
  "maxHourlyEnergyConsumption": 12.5,
  "userId": "{{syncUserId}}"
}

> {%
    client.test("Dispozitivul a fost salvat cu succes", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200 || response.status === 201, "Dispozitivul nu a putut fi asociat");
    });
    // Salveaza automat UUID-ul dispozitivului creat
    client.global.set("syncDeviceId", response.body);
    client.log("Device creat si mapat cu ID: " + response.body);
%}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### PASUL 3: Preluare Dispozitive alocate acestui utilizator
### Verifica daca dispozitivul apare mapat pe utilizatorul respectiv.
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{deviceApi}}/device/user/{{syncUserId}}
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### PASUL 4: TEST NEGATIV - Incercare de alocare catre un User inexistent
### Trimitem un UUID inventat. Din cauza constrangerii de Foreign Key din
### tabela locala user_account, cererea TREBUIE sa fie refuzata (Eroare 4xx / 5xx).
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{deviceApi}}/device
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Smart Meter Fantoma",
  "address": "Adresa Necunoscuta",
  "maxHourlyEnergyConsumption": 5.0,
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### PASUL 5: TESTUL DE FOC - Stergerea Utilizatorului din user-service
### 1. user-service trimite DELETE catre device-service/user/{{syncUserId}}
### 2. device-service sterge randul din user_account
### 3. ON DELETE CASCADE sterge automat dispozitivul creat la Pasul 2!
### 4. user-service sterge utilizatorul din tabela sa person
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{userApi}}/person/{{syncUserId}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### PASUL 6: Verificare Cascada - Dispozitivul a disparut automat?
### Incercam sa citim dispozitivul creat la Pasul 2.
### Daca raspunsul este 404 Not Found, stergerea cascadata a functionat impecabil!
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{deviceApi}}/device/{{syncDeviceId}}
Accept: application/json